+Classification (the v2 gate -- do not regress it)
+-------------------------------------------------
+For an entry with path ``p``, recorded digest ``r`` and on-disk bytes ``d``::
 
-Writes nothing except the optional ``--json`` output path; ``--strict`` is opt-in and only escalates
-a non-empty ``stale`` list to a non-zero exit.
+    normalize_eol(b) = b.replace(b"\\r\\n", b"\\n")                  # CRLF -> LF
+    crlf_eol(b)      = normalize_eol(b).replace(b"\\n", b"\\r\\n")   # lone LF -> CRLF
